{"real": false, "dur": 119.43, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 2.32, "text": "This is where FluOLinGo began.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "is", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "where", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "FluOLinGo", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "began.", "s": 1.94}]}, {"start": 2.67, "end": 6.13, "text": "It teaches beginner French using our course book, L’Atelier.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 2.67}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 3.06}, {"w": "beginner", "s": 3.44}, {"w": "French", "s": 3.83}, {"w": "using", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "our", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "course", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "book,", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "L’Atelier.", "s": 5.75}]}, {"start": 6.48, "end": 14.95, "text": "In the first version, I cut the course into fifty small goals across five units and laid them out on a map.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 6.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.87}, {"w": "first", "s": 7.25}, {"w": "version,", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "I", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "cut", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "course", "s": 9.18}, {"w": "into", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "fifty", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "small", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "goals", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "across", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "five", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "units", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "and", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "laid", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "them", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "out", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "on", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "a", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "map.", "s": 14.56}]}, {"start": 15.3, "end": 20.3, "text": "That’s the left side of the slide: fifty numbered goals in a row.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "left", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "side", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "of", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "slide:", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "fifty", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "numbered", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "goals", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "in", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "a", "s": 19.53}, {"w": "row.", "s": 19.91}]}, {"start": 20.65, "end": 22.95, "text": "Every exercise belonged to a goal.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "s": 20.65}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 21.03}, {"w": "belonged", "s": 21.42}, {"w": "to", "s": 21.8}, {"w": "a", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "goal.", "s": 22.57}]}, {"start": 23.3, "end": 28.69, "text": "In other words, I started with the goal, then built the exercises around it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "other", "s": 23.69}, {"w": "words,", "s": 24.07}, {"w": "I", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "started", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "with", "s": 25.23}, {"w": "the", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "goal,", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "then", "s": 26.38}, {"w": "built", "s": 26.77}, {"w": "the", "s": 27.15}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 27.53}, {"w": "around", "s": 27.92}, {"w": "it.", "s": 28.3}]}, {"start": 29.04, "end": 31.73, "text": "But look at three of those goals.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "look", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "at", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "three", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "of", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "those", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 31.35}]}, {"start": 32.08, "end": 34.0, "text": "Number twenty-eight, negation, is linguistic.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "twenty-eight,", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "negation,", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "is", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "linguistic.", "s": 33.62}]}, {"start": 34.35, "end": 38.58, "text": "Number twenty-nine, inviting someone and turning down an invitation, is communicative.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 34.35}, {"w": "twenty-nine,", "s": 34.74}, {"w": "inviting", "s": 35.12}, {"w": "someone", "s": 35.51}, {"w": "and", "s": 35.89}, {"w": "turning", "s": 36.28}, {"w": "down", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "an", "s": 37.05}, {"w": "invitation,", "s": 37.43}, {"w": "is", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "communicative.", "s": 38.2}]}, {"start": 38.93, "end": 42.4, "text": "Number thirty, writing an email, is a whole task.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 38.93}, {"w": "thirty,", "s": 39.32}, {"w": "writing", "s": 39.7}, {"w": "an", "s": 40.09}, {"w": "email,", "s": 40.47}, {"w": "is", "s": 40.86}, {"w": "a", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "whole", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "task.", "s": 42.01}]}, {"start": 42.75, "end": 47.75, "text": "On the map, though, all three looked exactly the same: one stop each.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 42.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 43.13}, {"w": "map,", "s": 43.52}, {"w": "though,", "s": 43.9}, {"w": "all", "s": 44.28}, {"w": "three", "s": 44.67}, {"w": "looked", "s": 45.05}, {"w": "exactly", "s": 45.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 45.82}, {"w": "same:", "s": 46.21}, {"w": "one", "s": 46.59}, {"w": "stop", "s": 46.98}, {"w": "each.", "s": 47.36}]}, {"start": 48.1, "end": 53.48, "text": "And that was a problem, because they are not the same kind of thing.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 48.1}, {"w": "that", "s": 48.48}, {"w": "was", "s": 48.87}, {"w": "a", "s": 49.25}, {"w": "problem,", "s": 49.63}, {"w": "because", "s": 50.02}, {"w": "they", "s": 50.4}, {"w": "are", "s": 50.79}, {"w": "not", "s": 51.17}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.56}, {"w": "same", "s": 51.94}, {"w": "kind", "s": 52.33}, {"w": "of", "s": 52.71}, {"w": "thing.", "s": 53.1}]}, {"start": 53.83, "end": 56.14, "text": "Negation is one small building block.", "words": [{"w": "Negation", "s": 53.83}, {"w": "is", "s": 54.22}, {"w": "one", "s": 54.6}, {"w": "small", "s": 54.98}, {"w": "building", "s": 55.37}, {"w": "block.", "s": 55.75}]}, {"start": 56.49, "end": 62.26, "text": "Writing an email is a whole piece of work that needs many of those blocks.", "words": [{"w": "Writing", "s": 56.49}, {"w": "an", "s": 56.87}, {"w": "email", "s": 57.26}, {"w": "is", "s": 57.64}, {"w": "a", "s": 58.03}, {"w": "whole", "s": 58.41}, {"w": "piece", "s": 58.8}, {"w": "of", "s": 59.18}, {"w": "work", "s": 59.57}, {"w": "that", "s": 59.95}, {"w": "needs", "s": 60.33}, {"w": "many", "s": 60.72}, {"w": "of", "s": 61.1}, {"w": "those", "s": 61.49}, {"w": "blocks.", "s": 61.87}]}, {"start": 62.61, "end": 72.22, "text": "So a learner moving along the map could not tell a small step from a big one, or see which goals the email depended on.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 62.61}, {"w": "a", "s": 62.99}, {"w": "learner", "s": 63.38}, {"w": "moving", "s": 63.76}, {"w": "along", "s": 64.15}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.53}, {"w": "map", "s": 64.92}, {"w": "could", "s": 65.3}, {"w": "not", "s": 65.68}, {"w": "tell", "s": 66.07}, {"w": "a", "s": 66.45}, {"w": "small", "s": 66.84}, {"w": "step", "s": 67.22}, {"w": "from", "s": 67.61}, {"w": "a", "s": 67.99}, {"w": "big", "s": 68.38}, {"w": "one,", "s": 68.76}, {"w": "or", "s": 69.15}, {"w": "see", "s": 69.53}, {"w": "which", "s": 69.92}, {"w": "goals", "s": 70.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 70.68}, {"w": "email", "s": 71.07}, {"w": "depended", "s": 71.45}, {"w": "on.", "s": 71.84}]}, {"start": 72.57, "end": 81.42, "text": "At first, I didn’t notice this, because I was simply following the French book, which already sorts its content into situations and tasks.", "words": [{"w": "At", "s": 72.57}, {"w": "first,", "s": 72.96}, {"w": "I", "s": 73.34}, {"w": "didn’t", "s": 73.73}, {"w": "notice", "s": 74.11}, {"w": "this,", "s": 74.5}, {"w": "because", "s": 74.88}, {"w": "I", "s": 75.27}, {"w": "was", "s": 75.65}, {"w": "simply", "s": 76.03}, {"w": "following", "s": 76.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 76.8}, {"w": "French", "s": 77.19}, {"w": "book,", "s": 77.57}, {"w": "which", "s": 77.96}, {"w": "already", "s": 78.34}, {"w": "sorts", "s": 78.73}, {"w": "its", "s": 79.11}, {"w": "content", "s": 79.5}, {"w": "into", "s": 79.88}, {"w": "situations", "s": 80.27}, {"w": "and", "s": 80.65}, {"w": "tasks.", "s": 81.03}]}, {"start": 81.77, "end": 86.38, "text": "But when I started planning the Chinese version, that support was gone.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 81.77}, {"w": "when", "s": 82.15}, {"w": "I", "s": 82.54}, {"w": "started", "s": 82.92}, {"w": "planning", "s": 83.31}, {"w": "the", "s": 83.69}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 84.08}, {"w": "version,", "s": 84.46}, {"w": "that", "s": 84.85}, {"w": "support", "s": 85.23}, {"w": "was", "s": 85.62}, {"w": "gone.", "s": 86.0}]}, {"start": 86.73, "end": 90.97, "text": "The Chinese book has no situations and no tasks at all.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 86.73}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 87.12}, {"w": "book", "s": 87.5}, {"w": "has", "s": 87.89}, {"w": "no", "s": 88.27}, {"w": "situations", "s": 88.66}, {"w": "and", "s": 89.04}, {"w": "no", "s": 89.43}, {"w": "tasks", "s": 89.81}, {"w": "at", "s": 90.2}, {"w": "all.", "s": 90.58}]}, {"start": 91.32, "end": 97.08, "text": "That meant I had to decide, for every step, what kind of step it was.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 91.32}, {"w": "meant", "s": 91.7}, {"w": "I", "s": 92.08}, {"w": "had", "s": 92.47}, {"w": "to", "s": 92.85}, {"w": "decide,", "s": 93.24}, {"w": "for", "s": 93.62}, {"w": "every", "s": 94.01}, {"w": "step,", "s": 94.39}, {"w": "what", "s": 94.78}, {"w": "kind", "s": 95.16}, {"w": "of", "s": 95.55}, {"w": "step", "s": 95.93}, {"w": "it", "s": 96.32}, {"w": "was.", "s": 96.7}]}, {"start": 97.43, "end": 102.82, "text": "And that is when I saw that the map was mixing three different kinds.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 97.43}, {"w": "that", "s": 97.82}, {"w": "is", "s": 98.2}, {"w": "when", "s": 98.59}, {"w": "I", "s": 98.97}, {"w": "saw", "s": 99.36}, {"w": "that", "s": 99.74}, {"w": "the", "s": 100.13}, {"w": "map", "s": 100.51}, {"w": "was", "s": 100.9}, {"w": "mixing", "s": 101.28}, {"w": "three", "s": 101.67}, {"w": "different", "s": 102.05}, {"w": "kinds.", "s": 102.43}]}, {"start": 103.17, "end": 105.86, "text": "On the right is the revised structure.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 103.17}, {"w": "the", "s": 103.55}, {"w": "right", "s": 103.94}, {"w": "is", "s": 104.32}, {"w": "the", "s": 104.71}, {"w": "revised", "s": 105.09}, {"w": "structure.", "s": 105.48}]}, {"start": 106.21, "end": 114.67, "text": "Each unit now has two kinds of goal, linguistic and communicative, and one task at the end, where learners use both together.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 106.21}, {"w": "unit", "s": 106.6}, {"w": "now", "s": 106.98}, {"w": "has", "s": 107.37}, {"w": "two", "s": 107.75}, {"w": "kinds", "s": 108.13}, {"w": "of", "s": 108.52}, {"w": "goal,", "s": 108.9}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 109.29}, {"w": "and", "s": 109.67}, {"w": "communicative,", "s": 110.06}, {"w": "and", "s": 110.44}, {"w": "one", "s": 110.83}, {"w": "task", "s": 111.21}, {"w": "at", "s": 111.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 111.98}, {"w": "end,", "s": 112.37}, {"w": "where", "s": 112.75}, {"w": "learners", "s": 113.13}, {"w": "use", "s": 113.52}, {"w": "both", "s": 113.9}, {"w": "together.", "s": 114.29}]}, {"start": 115.02, "end": 118.48, "text": "And you’ll see that same structure in both languages.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 115.02}, {"w": "you’ll", "s": 115.41}, {"w": "see", "s": 115.79}, {"w": "that", "s": 116.18}, {"w": "same", "s": 116.56}, {"w": "structure", "s": 116.95}, {"w": "in", "s": 117.33}, {"w": "both", "s": 117.72}, {"w": "languages.", "s": 118.1}]}]}